    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/oramond_quest/chavis/magistrate-lore",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.oramond_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.chavis",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "magistrate"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "They act so important but it is us common people who keep things going. There is a lot you can do in this city to earn a right to vote in the magistrate, though. So keep an eye out for everyone who needs help."
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/chavis.lua:105"
      ],
      "exclude_keywords": [
        "food",
        "yes",
        "root"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/oramond_quest/chavis/rathleton-lore",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.oramond_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.chavis",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "rathleton"
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "reply": [
        "Don't be fooled, we have here masters and servants like everywhere else. The whole system is a scam to subdue the masses, to fool them about what is really happening. ...",
        "The system only ensures that the rich have a better control and the labourers are only used."
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "set_topic",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/chavis.lua:107"
      ],
      "exclude_keywords": [
        "food",
        "yes",
        "root",
        "magistrate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "oteryn:quest-npc/oramond_quest/doubleday/experiment",
      "quest": "oteryn:quest.oramond_quest",
      "npc": "oteryn:npc.doubleday",
      "trigger": "say",
      "keywords": [
        "experiment"
      ],
      "guards": [
        {
          "kind": "storage",
          "track": "oteryn:quest-progress/quest/u10_50/oramond_quest/probing/mission",
          "op": "eq",
          "value": -1
        }
      ],
      "reply": [
        "Yes, well I am working on something very time-consuming at the moment. You see, a lot of us don't have time to go out much, to converse even just to meet and talk about recent discoveries. ...",
        "So I thought about a device to help communication in this wonderful city. I already had a helper, he was easily... 'stressed' and quit. Didn't have time to find a new one. ...",
        "So, if you'd like to help - there is a lot to do for me to bring my plans to fruition - and if you help me, you will earn my {votes} for the {magistrate} in turn! Are you in?"
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "set_topic",
          "value": 1
        }
      ],
      "sources": [
        "crystal:201189f871d23597b82caf88fd611454a2ddefb8:data-global/npc/doubleday.lua:61"
      ]
    },
    {
